discography











Jaybay (also known as Jaybay Animal or 6ix Animal) has released several independent albums, EPs, and singles across platforms like Spotify, Apple Music, and his official @JayBayAnimal YouTube channel. [1, 2, 3]

Albums & Mixtapes
Free 6ix Animal (2024). An 8-track studio project featuring songs such as "Miss It," "Rackies," "Sleeping," "Solo," and "Product Of".
Animal. A full-length compilation/album featuring tracks including "Basic," "You Wouldn't," "Witness," "All Summer," "Bussin," "Yummies," and "Bodies".
Ready (2020). One of his earliest full-length releases available on major streaming platforms. [1, 2, 3]


EPs
Public Defender (2026). A recent extended play featuring tracks like "Wrong Route," "Moose Knuckle," "IDK," and "Life Sentence".
Trenches Baby (Deluxe) (2023). An expanded EP following his early underground traction.
Ocean Vol. 1 (2023). An early collaborative/solo EP release. [1, 2]


